{"id":"wb-3-216","name":"隋唐洛阳城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"隋唐洛阳城遗址","text":"隋唐洛阳城遗址位于河南省洛阳市近郊，始建于隋炀帝时期，格局仿照隋大兴城修建，时称东都或东京。历经了隋朝、唐朝、五代和北宋，前后沿用500余年，为隋唐的东都，北宋的西都。2010年被列为中国第一批国家考古遗址公园。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E5%94%90%E6%B4%9B%E9%98%B3%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92235432,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92235432","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2b6eabc7a69ac6fff72cff3f.jpg","title":"20231119_Yingtian_Gate_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20231119_Yingtian_Gate_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/20231119_Yingtian_Gate_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Museum of the site of Yingtian Gate","width":320,"height":213}}